+            // AXIOM: a 9-12B model routinely ends a turn by announcing its next step ("I will
+            // continue with the remaining modules...") instead of taking it. The loop is right
+            // that the turn produced no tool call, but the task plainly is not finished -- the
+            // model's own todo list still has unfinished items. Rather than accept that as
